	(text "K-6 / F-09: separate MCU, separate code base. It can only STOP: veto on the 48 V enable (SUP_VETO) and park line (PMD_AEN).\nS-07 (approved 10 Oct): encoder A/B also into TIM3 CH1/CH2 via its own series resistors.\nPin map DERIVED from the KiCad STM32C031C6Tx symbol (ST pin data); CONFIRM in CubeMX. NRST assumed on PF2 (PF2-NRST) - VERIFY.\nPackage LQFP48 (C6T6) ASSUMED; the C031C6 also exists in UFQFPN48 (C6U6)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
